WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:03.280
Good morning.
We're going fishing today.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:06.680
And we're going fishing for tuna.
Long fin tuna.&nbsp;

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:10.200
Hopefully we'll get a yellow&nbsp;
fin as well, but we'll see.&nbsp;

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.800
We're going to pick up Dad Ross&nbsp;
and then we'll be on our way.&nbsp;

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:17.920
We're going to Cape Town.
So fish on!&nbsp;

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:21.200
Hold.
Hold it.&nbsp;

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:29.840
Keep reeling, reel, reel, reel,&nbsp;
reel, keep the line still.

